    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Theme and new information",
     "texto": [
      "Often the known topic comes first and the new information comes at the end: Встреча состоится в пятницу. If the question is Когда состоится встреча?, the ending gives the answer. Context guides the order."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The focus can change",
     "texto": [
      "Мария отправила отчёт директору and Отчёт директору отправила Мария can both be correct; the second may highlight who sent the report. A marked word order needs a communicative reason."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Focus markers",
     "texto": [
      "Именно and как раз highlight the word that follows: Именно редакция проверила источник. Ведь and же add emphasis or appeal to shared information, but they are not freely interchangeable."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
